    "description": "Class III, mains or battery-operated, self-indicating, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instrument consisting of a CI-200 Series indicator connected to a weighing platform. Features: alphanumeric keypad, battery indicators (low, charging), initial zero setting device on power up, semi-automatic zero setting, optional zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, zero-indicator, indication of stable equilibrium, net indicator, gravity compensation, printing, hold function. Any compatible load cell may be used provided it holds an OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity containing the required load cell data; a load cell marked NH is allowed only if humidity testing to R76 has been conducted on it; compatibility is established by the manufacturer by means of the compatibility of modules calculation."
